      "writtenOn": "2023-03-23T09:49:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Each app has a 1/128 chance of having recoverable gwp-asan enabled -\u003e 1/2500 chance of malloc() being serviced by gwp-asan -\u003e ??% chance that the malloc is used for a heap-use-after-free or heap-buffer-overflow.\n\nI reckon the order of magnitude is \u003c\u003d ~1 crash/day for real users. Maybe some really awful apps could inflate that to ~a few/day.",
      "parentUuid": "5dab75ba_40c21392",
